  "acceptance": [
    "Immediate irreversible drain refuses new player work through existing availability guards; tracked periodic/signal work settles before existing app/authority and pool close sequence. Same12s total budget and explicit failed-stop semantics.",
    "Actual main processes blocked on real owned PG table locks exit0 when released and exit1 at deadline when stuck, with no owner remaining. Existing real SIGKILL/SIGSTOP/takeover and paused-publication tests pass.",
    "Actual scoped API DB-access failure fences old room commands/broadcasts and disconnects old socket; restoring credentials cannot reacquire old authority. Same identity can join a replacement with fresh epoch/membership after mandatory resync.",
    "Actual durable reward effect and delivery receipt COMMIT drain together; restart does not duplicate rewards/completion/delivery. Full integration includes current transaction/travel/privacy/revoke/order/reward cases.",
    "Proposed runtime-fault command implemented before execution; original tests/thresholds and production12s deadline unchanged. Additional strict fixture types fixed without removing expectations or altering production domain behavior."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Local source/tsx processes and disposable PG17.7; no fresh image/TLS/cluster/staging downtime or release certification. Singleton guard is not distributed fencing or zero downtime.",
    "Role-scoped DB-access failure is not an entire PG server/network outage. Actual SIGINT and SIGHUP-in-flight process cases not independently exercised; helper ordering covers admitted signal work.",
    "At deadline uncompleted transactions may abort or have uncertain client outcome; durable receipts/reconciliation remain authoritative. No guarantee every business operation finishes before process exit.",
    "Full check started before type-only test fixture annotations were refined; final application/test source is pinned and all final cases/types pass. Initial failed attempts retained.",
    "No standalone worker/admin/mobile/published release or public/store/adult/media/operator approval. Hosted Deadline cadence/enforcement unresolved, N13/N14 inactive. Raw evidence private local, not off-host archived."
  ],
